#### **Recent period: 2001--2025**

During 2001–2025, later predicted egg hatch and adult emergence were more apparent across portions of the northern and western United States, while earlier events occurred in scattered central and eastern areas (@fig-slf-emergence-recent, @fig-slf-egg-hatch-recent). Significant changes were relatively limited in spatial extent.


