### **ii. Climatic suitability**

#### **Entire period: 1981--2025**

Predicted cold stress decreased across much of the northern United States over 1981–2025, whereas heat stress increased in the western and southern United States (@fig-slf-cold-stress, @fig-slf-heat-stress). Climatic-suitability changes were limited, with significant increases occurring mainly in localized northern areas (@fig-slf-suitability).


